OL,3,CCelebrations as Ipswich Town bounce
OL,4,Cback to the Premier League
OL,6,FIpswich Town are breathing a huge sigh
OL,7,Fof relief after leaving it to the last
OL,8,Fday of the season to secure automatic
OL,9,Fpromotion to the Premier League.
OL,11,FThe favourites for that coveted second-
OL,12,Fplace spot found themselves in an
OL,13,Fundesirable three-way battle with
OL,14,FMillwall and Middlesbrough.
OL,16,FBut the Blues had control of their own
OL,17,Ffate, knowing a win against QPR would
OL,18,Fguarantee promotion no matter what the
OL,19,Fother teams did.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
