OL,3,CCelebrations as Ipswich Town bounce
OL,4,Cback to the Premier League
OL,6,FAnd, despite high pressure and
OL,7,Fexpectations, they held their nerve,
OL,8,Fbeating the west Londoners 3-0 thanks
OL,9,Fto goals from George Hirst and Jaden
OL,10,FPhilogene in the first ten minutes and
OL,11,Fa third from Kasey McAteer in the
OL,12,Fclosing stages.
OL,14,FIt wasn't pretty, but Ipswich lived up
OL,15,Fto expectations, says ITV News
OL,16,FAnglia's Andy Ward
OL,18,FThe same incredible outcome for
OL,19,FIpswich Town, but a slightly different
OL,20,Ffeeling.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
