OL,3,CCelebrations as Ipswich Town bounce
OL,4,Cback to the Premier League
OL,6,FTwo years ago, Town were the
OL,7,Funderdogs. A team who took on the
OL,8,Fmight of clubs boasting parachute
OL,9,Fpayments, and won.
OL,11,FIt was a side riding on the crest of a
OL,12,Fwave having been promoted from League
OL,13,FOne the season before, and one that
OL,14,Fcarried that momentum all the way to
OL,15,Fthe Premier League.
OL,17,FMany fans dared to dream, but few
OL,18,Ftruly believed it would be possible.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
