OL,3,CCelebrations as Ipswich Town bounce
OL,4,Cback to the Premier League
OL,6,FOn this occasion, the expectations
OL,7,Fwere much higher. This time, it was
OL,8,FIpswich who were the ones being hunted
OL,9,Fand the ones with all the odds stacked
OL,10,Fin their favour.
OL,12,FEveryone expected them to bounce back
OL,13,Fat the first attempt, with the
OL,14,Fmajority of pundits tipping them to go
OL,15,Fup as champions.
OL,17,FThe title may have alluded them, but
OL,18,Fwho cares? This was all about getting
OL,19,Fthe job done, by hook or by crook, and
OL,20,FIpswich have done it.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
