OL,3,CCelebrations as Ipswich Town bounce
OL,4,Cback to the Premier League
OL,6,FHave Town been as fluent and pleasing
OL,7,Fon the eye as they were two years ago?
OL,8,FProbably not.
OL,10,FBut being favourites for promotion
OL,11,Fbrings with it a huge amount of
OL,12,Fpressure. Every club is desperate to
OL,13,Fbeat you, to lay down a marker.
OL,15,FAnd Kieran McKenna's side have dealt
OL,16,Fwith it admirably. They've been almost
OL,17,Ffaultless at Portman Road, with only
OL,18,Fchampions Coventry City boasting a
OL,19,Fbetter home record, and they've won
OL,20,Fkey matches when it mattered most.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/6
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
